hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1375","Muhammad bin Yahya told us, Abu Nu’aym told us, Shayban told us, on the authority of Yahya bin Abi Kathir, on the authority of Abu Salamah, on the authority of Abdullah bin Amr, “When the sun was eclipsed during the time of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, it was proclaimed, ‘The prayer is united,’” so he mentioned the hadith. Abu Bakr said: This was also narrated by Muawiyah bin Salam, on the authority of Yahya, on the authority of Abu Salamah, on the authority of Abdullah bin Amr."
"1376","It was narrated by Al-Hajjaj Al-Sawwaf, who said: Yahya told me, Abu Salamah told me, Abdullah bin Amr told me, Muhammad bin Yahya told me, Abu Bakr bin told me. Abu Al-Aswad, Humaid bin Al-Aswad told us, on the authority of Hajjaj Al-Sawaf, he said: I heard Muhammad bin Yahya, saying: Hajjaj Al-Sawaf is Mateen, he means that Trustworthy and preservative"
